    schema1:value "²⁵Mg → Mg; ²⁷Al → Al; ³¹P → P; ⁴³Ca → Ca; ⁴⁴Ca → Ca; ⁴⁵Sc → Sc; ⁴⁷Ti → Ti; ⁴⁹Ti → Ti; ⁵¹V → V; ⁵²Cr → Cr; ⁵³Cr → Cr; ⁵⁹Co → Co; ⁶⁰Ni → Ni; ⁶¹Ni → Ni; ⁶²Ni → Ni; ⁶⁴Zn → Zn; ⁶⁶Zn → Zn; ⁶⁹Ga → Ga; ⁷¹Ga → Ga — 'The nuclides measured were 25Mg, 27Al, 31P, 43Ca, 44Ca, 45Sc, 47Ti, 49Ti, 51V, 52Cr, 53Cr, 59Co, 60Ni, 61Ni, 62Ni, 64Zn, 66Zn, 69Ga and 71Ga' (§3.3)" .

